{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warping War Pig is an endless runner where you fight hordes of UFOs and encounter deadly bosses. WWP is played with the mouse only - you're free to use your other hand the whole time! Simply press and hold to make the War Pig go <strong>UP</strong>, and let go to make that flying pig go <strong>DOWN</strong>. You The warpig automatically blasts any enemies with rockets that enter his radar. Collect cabbage emeralds in order to upgrade your weaponry - for the warp win! You can also hold <strong>SPACEBAR</strong>\u00a0to fly upwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the wackiness starts is when you <strong>WARP</strong>! Drag your mouse to make the War Pig teleport to your mouse cursor! This is the only way to properly zoom 'n boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom 'n boom with the craziest outer space war pig around! Get MAJOR upgrades, fill out your Quimdex with 100 outer space outlaws to collect, and blast through multiple INSANE worlds. Warp with me now! Enjoy <strong>four</strong>\u00a0Steam leaderboards and OODLES of cheevos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972680/extras/b40ab3e011cf442f0fd866064422c80b.avif?t=1757413060\" width=768 height=893 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972680?t=1757413060","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972680/80c2b7ab015035db734da12643c2be43d544a502/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757413060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972680/1f5c932a08ed152ff2c856a9fdd90c45fe971ae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757413060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972680/1f5c932a08ed152ff2c856a9fd